flowchart TD
    A[User selects difficulty] --> B[Streamlit App - app.py]
    B --> C[logic_utils.py: get_range_for_difficulty]
    C --> D[Secret number generated]

    subgraph Agentic Loop - agent.py
        E[PLAN: pick next guess via binary search] --> F[ACT: check_guess against secret]
        F --> G{CHECK: outcome consistent with range?}
        G -- No --> H[GUARDRAIL: log error, stop]
        G -- Yes --> I[Update range low/high]
        I --> J{Win?}
        J -- No --> E
        J -- Yes --> K[Return result: solved, attempts, history]
    end

    D --> E
    K --> L[agent_log.txt: full trace of guesses and outcomes]
    K --> M[pytest test suite: verifies solve rate and guardrail behavior]

    subgraph Human Oversight
        N[Developer reviews agent_log.txt]
        O[Developer runs pytest to verify reliability]
    end

    L --> N
    M --> O
